|---|---|
| **Features extracted** | 1 (Polygon) |
| **Geometry type** | Polygon |
| **CRS** | Not defined in source (likely WGS84/NAD83 geographic) |
| **Centroid** | ≈ (-104.69, 41.31) |
| **Output files generated** | `.shp`, `.shx`, `.dbf`, `.prj`, `.cpg` |
